TITLE:: HeuristicRules
summary:: Expert system rules for auditory scene analysis.
categories:: Logic, Analysis

DESCRIPTION::
HeuristicRules implements a set of "if-then" rules that guide the Auditory Scene Analysis process. These rules are based on music theory, psychoacoustics, and empirical observations of vocal behavior.

LIST::
## STRONG::Octave Rule::: Prefer the lower octave if harmonic evidence is ambiguous.
## STRONG::Vibrato Coherence::: Group tracks that share synchronous frequency modulation.
## STRONG::Proximity Rule::: Prefer tracking connections between pitches that are close in frequency and time.
::
